    Bug 1882368 - Show the account color indicator when inside a virtual folder. r=darktrojan,klamping,freaktechnik,ablenkin

    Implement the account indicator when using Unified folder modes.
    The account indicator is showed both alongside folders and messages.

    #### How to test

    - Have at least 2 email accounts.
    - Customize the account colors inside the Account Settings of each account.
    - Ensure to have at least once message in each inbox of the accounts.
    - Enable Unified folder mode from the menu of the folder tree.
    - Confirm that the account indicator is visible for folders and messages.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D295910

